            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Bengali for wholesale, then the Bengali for to stock up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: দাঁড়িপাল্লা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "দাঁড়িপাল্লা — dā̃ṛipāllā — \"a pair of scales; a balance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মুদি দাঁড়িপাল্লায় ডাল ওজন করলেন। mudi dā̃ṛipāllāy ḍāl ojôn kôrlen. The grocer weighed the lentils on the scales."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The hanging scales of a market stall: a beam, the দাঁড়ি, with two pans, the পাল্লা."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "দাঁড়িপাল্লা (dā̃ṛipāllā) joins দাঁড়ি, which CDIAL lists as Bengali ḍā̃ṛi, \"the beam of a balance\", under Sanskrit daṇḍá, \"a stick\" (CDIAL 6128), to পাল্লা, \"a scale-pan\", whose own origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
